WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Resurrected Digivices!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
A New Shining Light!

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.630
Resurrected Digivices!

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.500
A New Shining Light!

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:16.900
Fiercely attacked by the Bio Digimon, Masaru and the others were driven to the wall.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.640
Just when they were at their wits' end, and on the verge of being destroyed,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.180
something unusual happened to their Digivices.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.480
Using the power of their Digivices' abnormal light,

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.300
Masaru and the others attained a radical victory.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:34.640
However, they paid the price by destroying their Digivices.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.120
Damn it...

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:41.790
Damn it!

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.500
Damn it!

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.600
Calm down, Kouki.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.130
Your angry outbursts won't do you any good.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.090
We should've <i>won</i> !

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:54.970
And yet...

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.360
Just what the hell was that?!

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.580
You sound rather angered, Kouki-kun.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.600
I understand how you feel, but your mission must come first.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:08.960
Kurata.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.780
It's hard to believe they'll be a big threat to us when they don't even have the backup of their organization.

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:19.280
Please devote yourselves to the Digimon hunt for the time being.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:21.990
Like I care about that.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.700
This...

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.780
has to do with my pride!

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:30.660
My, my.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:33.890
However, it's true...

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.330
that we were defeated.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.550
Makes it difficult to start the day off right.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.360
I don't care either way.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.300
Digisoul Charge!

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.270
It's really no use.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.780
So all of our Digivices are useless.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.530
At this rate...

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.820
We'll end up with a completely one-sided defeat.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.200
Like I said!

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.780
If we find Dad, he'll fix them for us!

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.140
That's right!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.790
You think we'll get anywhere by randomly searching through this Digital World?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:13.780
So?

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.750
It's better than doing nothing!

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.210
All right then.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:21.930
Let's start at a place where we can find leads on Professor Daimon.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.390
Leads on Dad...

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.940
You mean Wanderer's Cape?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.980
Yeah.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.650
Even if the possibility is low, we should still give it another search.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.050
All right!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.730
Then let's get going!

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:40.820
Yeah!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.450
Masaru!

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.650
What are you doing all of a sudden?

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:51.500
Quiet!

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:53.560
It's them.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:02.290
Come on out, Daimon Masaru!

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:04.310
Bear with it!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.400
Don't be playing games!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.350
Right now, repairing our Digivices comes first!

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:08.500
Stop hiding and show yourself!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.850
You coward!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.250
Bear with it!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.400
Come out!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.650
It's a good thing they didn't notice us.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.860
Let's go.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:25.420
I'll definitely pay them back for this next time.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.800
It was around here, right?

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:34.500
Yeah.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.060
What's that, Aniki?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.310
What is that?

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.770
Anyway, let's check it out!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.730
Digisoul Dojo

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.410
This is...

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.080
Welcome to the Digisoul Dojo.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:02.510
You're...!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.900
BanchouLeomon!

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.570
What happened to the mansion here?

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.150
I don't know.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.030
But more importantly...

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.960
What does the Digisoul mean to you?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.480
Let me ask you once again.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.280
What is the Digisoul?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:26.880
Huh?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.790
What the hell are you talking about?

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:34.730
What?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.890
Wanna take a shot at me?

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.250
Stop it, Masaru.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.500
It doesn't look like he's picking a fight.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.650
Stop making me repeat myself.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.960
I'm asking you what you know about the Digisoul.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.170
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.930
It has to do with evolution... right?

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.720
What are <i>you</i>  talking about?

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.500
The Digisoul is...

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.170
Huh?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.230
What is it anyway?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:08.950
But when you really think about it, what can the Digisoul be?

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.180
I see.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:14.080
It's only natural that your Digivices broke from that dismal level of understanding.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:15.460
What did you say?!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.010
How did you know that?

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.160
Follow me.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.630
Then the path to your future will open.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.730
What should we do?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.960
We have no other option.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.880
BanchouLeomon knows something.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:34.580
As long as I get to punch that gakuran-wearing bastard, I don't care what we do!

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:38.890
NOTE: A <i>gakuran</i> (学らん) is the traditional Japanese school uniform jacket that BanchouLeomon has on.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.990
Then let's go.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.580
Let's go, too.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.360
You guys will wait here.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:50.030
This is something you'll need in order to fight alongside them in the future.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.130
You should believe in your partners and wait.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.240
What do you mean?

00:06:54.610 --> 00:07:00.070
The next time they come out here, they should be stronger.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:10.630
Digisoul

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.900
Now,

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.090
tell us.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.300
What do you know?

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.940
Before that, let me tell you one thing.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:23.270
As long as you are unable to get a good command of your Digisouls,

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.480
you will have no future.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.810
Shut up!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.610
You've got no right to go on lecturing us!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:33.320
Watch it.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.700
It won't be me you'll be fighting against.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.220
Wh-What are those?

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.250
Here is the condition you must clear in order to complete your training.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.330
Completely destroy these wooden figures.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.720
Once you do, a new world will be open to you.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.180
We never agreed to this!

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:59.650
We just want to know how to repair our Digivices!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:00.900
That's all!

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.550
Be more aware of your gullibility.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:09.150
If you can't overcome this trial, everything you do will be futile.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.170
What?

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.650
This is absurd.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:16.840
We have no plans to go along with your ludicrous training.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:17.530
Excuse us.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.310
Tohma!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:20.580
What's that?

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:21.990
A barrier?

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.120
Don't be naïve.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:27.460
Your training has already started.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.590
You can't get out of here until you've completed it.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.970
Don't leave out something important like that!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.110
Outta my way!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.470
Not a bad punch.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.470
But...

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.750
your fists aren't the only source of power.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.150
For power, you need a strong heart and unwavering courage!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.550
Wait!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:03.820
Wait, wait, wait!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:04.500
Wait!

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.670
I said, wait up!

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.500
Hey, Gaomon!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.610
Hmm?

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.310
Do you think Aniki and the others are okay?

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:21.680
That BanchouLeomon told us to wait and believe in our partners, but...

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:25.550
Hey, Gaomon and Agumon.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.690
Do you think we can trust that BanchouLeomon?

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:32.070
I don't know.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.440
But...

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.280
I'm getting kinda hungry.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.700
I think it's okay to trust him.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:41.780
Why is that?

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.580
Just... because...

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.290
I guess I'll trust him...

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.350
Keep it up...

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:03.310
The Digisoul is not controlled solely by brute strength.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:07.770
It is mastered using the cries of your heart and the strength of your will!

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.480
That is the shortcut to the ultimate Digisoul!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.780
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.920
But it looks like we have a long way to go.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.420
Skip, skip, jump!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:34.940
Skip, skip, jump!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.140
Okay, you're next, Agumon!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.450
Okay!

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:40.970
Here I go!

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.620
What's wrong, Agumon?

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.920
Hurry up and start!

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:50.560
Someone's coming!

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:51.760
What?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.750
Finally found ya.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.500
Where are your partners?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.420
Damn it...

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.750
You can't just discharge your Digisoul.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:19.280
Refine it, condense it, and focus all of it into one point!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.970
Damn it!

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.190
Not good enough!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.150
What's that?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:37.690
Let me ask again...

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.820
Where are your partners?

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.490
You think we'd tell you?!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.700
They're inside that building, right?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.060
Now that we know that...

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.270
you're in the way.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.900
Move!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.320
Agumon, Lalamon!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.150
You know what to do, right?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:57.590
Yeah!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:57.590
Yeah!

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:00.290
Just like BanchouLeomon said,

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:02.260
we'll wait and believe in our partners!

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.970
I'll beat the crap out of those guys for Aniki!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.780
Even if we can't evolve,

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:12.550
we must hold our ground somehow until they return!

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:15.700
I said, you're in the way.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.670
Thunder Storm!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:23.930
Again?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.490
Why is the ground shaking?

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.410
What's going on out there?!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.830
Even if you knew, there's nothing you can do.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.770
You can't say that, that only bothers us even more!

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:38.790
That's...!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.460
Shell Needle Rain!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.180
Agumon!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.180
Lalamon!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.180
Gaomon!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.090
Agumon!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.180
BanchouLeomon!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.060
Lift this barrier right now!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:55.520
I can't do that.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.520
Are you telling us to abandon our partners?!

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.830
If you want to leave this place...

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.360
hurry and finish your training!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:06.820
Agumon!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:08.810
We can still go on...

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:14.290
Aniki and the others <i>will</i>  get stronger and come back!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.960
For us, in Aniki...

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.500
In Master...

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.040
In Yoshino...

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.900
Our belief is strong!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.900
Our belief is strong!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.080
Gimme a break!

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.470
You little maggots!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:32.640
Agumon!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:32.640
Lalamon!

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:32.640
Gaomon!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.670
Agumon!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.470
Daimon...

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.580
MASARU!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:45.180
Stop sightseeing inside there and come on out already.

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:47.490
If you don't, he'll die.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:51.780
Agumon!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.470
Masaru!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.470
Masaru!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.080
Th-This light...!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.350
It's the same light as before!

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:15.810
What is this...?

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.300
That's not enough.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.250
Don't leave it all to your emotions.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.980
Control your Digisoul with the force of your will!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.460
Even if you tell me that, I don't...

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.230
What do you wish for?

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.410
What do you wish for?!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.920
My... wish...

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:40.290
I...

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.670
I want to save Agumon and the others!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.890
What just happened?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.470
Looks like you finally understand.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:54.970
What do you mean?

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.100
The Digisoul is the power of a human's feelings...

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.810
and the Digimon respond to those emotions!

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.520
That's right!

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:07.410
All of the Digimon who wandered into the human world all this time...

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.070
They appeared because they reacted to human desires!

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:14.980
Human desires are said to have seven classifications.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:15.740
But...

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:22.080
The untainted and geniune wish of wanting to protect someone is another type of desire.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:26.130
Once you are able to control that with your will,

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:28.800
the ultimate Digisoul will be born!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:34.010
Then, I'll fire up these emotions without holding back!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.530
Let's do it, too.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.300
Yeah.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:51.320
All right!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:52.150
Now!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:56.120
Strike those Digisouls into your Digivices!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.150
But...

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.310
our Digivices are already...

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.620
Just do it!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:07.960
The Digivice...!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:07.960
The Digivice...!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.400
That's the Digivice Burst.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:18.090
Your Digivices themselves took in your feelings and evolved.

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:21.160
Hammer the power of the Ultimate into them to your heart's content!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.800
What's that?

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:39.910
Here they come.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.700
Now it's getting interesting!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.160
Agumon!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:52.920
Aniki...

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.130
Sorry for the wait, Agumon!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.850
I believed in you...

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:01.560
Thank you.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:09.040
Now it's payback time for everything they've done to us!

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.650
Digisoul Charge!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.930
Overdrive!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:18.270
Agumon, evolve!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:26.070
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:26.070
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:31.030
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:31.030
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:33.140
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:33.140
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:36.760
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:36.760
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.340
ShineGreymon!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.340
ShineGreymon

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.340
Ultimate Level

